// APIKey lets a member call the API. It acts as that member, with the member's current role.
//
// The store keeps only the SHA-256 hash of the token (TokenHash) and its last four characters. Token is the full token: it is
// set only on the copy returned when the key is created, and on a key loaded from a snapshot written before tokens were
// hashed. Export never includes it. The API shows keys without Token and TokenHash.
